---
// Inline term chip — the recurring monospace concept label (e.g. a
// `Key result` object). `not-prose` keeps Tailwind Typography from adding its
// own backtick decorations around the <code>.
---
<code class="not-prose rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-slate-700"><slot /></code>
